        "Factor: 16 - (x - 3)^2 = (4 - (x - 3))(4 + (x - 3)) = (7 - x)(1 + x).",
        "As t goes from -pi/2 to pi/2, sin t goes from -1 to 1, so x goes from 1 to 5: p = 1, q = 5."
